From da549676f831c11cd7ba3bce5fc604a918db86ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincent Leon <leon@mbp.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:59:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): fold earlier activity groups under one heading

In activity grouping, the groups for work finished before the window now
sit under an Earlier heading. Its trailing button collapses every project
group at once, or expands them all once they are all collapsed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
